{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 01 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CNN 主干：从大规模分类到现代卷积</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CNN Backbones</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_082_googlenet___inception_v1-title\">GoogLeNet / Inception-v1</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">在每个 Inception module 中并行执行 1×1、降维后 3×3/5×5 和 pooling 分支，再通道拼接。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Parallel multi-scale branches (1×1, bottlenecked 3×3, 5×5 convolutions, and pooling) concatenated within each Inception module.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">2D 图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D image tensor</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">全局分类 logits 与多尺度中间特征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Global classification logits and multi-scale intermediate representations</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2015/html/Szegedy_Going_Deeper_With_2015_CVPR_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"GoogLeNet / Inception-v1 original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/d235919a60856ff7e968.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">卷积 Stem</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Convolutional Stem</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">大步长卷积/池化先降低空间分辨率</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image tensor and prepares initial tensor representations (Convolutional Stem).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"大步长卷积/池化先降低空间分辨率\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d image tensor and prepares initial tensor representations (Convolutional Stem).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"卷积 Stem\" data-node-name-en=\"Convolutional Stem\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">卷积 Stem</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Convolutional Stem</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">大步长卷积/池化先降低空间分辨率</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image tensor and prepares initial tensor representations (Convolutional Stem).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"直接 1×1 Conv 捕获通道组合\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes 1×1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"1×1 分支\" data-node-name-en=\"1×1\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">1×1 分支</span><span class=\"lang-en\">1×1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">直接 1×1 Conv 捕获通道组合</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes 1×1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"1×1 bottleneck 降维后接 3×3 Conv\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3×3 within the core multibranch inception cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"3×3 分支\" data-node-name-en=\"3×3\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">3×3 分支</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3×3</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">1×1 bottleneck 降维后接 3×3 Conv</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3×3 within the core multibranch inception cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"1×1 bottleneck 后接 5×5 Conv，覆盖更大局部尺度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 5×5 within the core multibranch inception cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"5×5 分支\" data-node-name-en=\"5×5\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">5×5 分支</span><span class=\"lang-en\">5×5</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">1×1 bottleneck 后接 5×5 Conv，覆盖更大局部尺度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 5×5 within the core multibranch inception cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"3×3 max-pool 后接 1×1 projection\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Pooling within the core multibranch inception cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Pooling 分支\" data-node-name-en=\"Pooling\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Pooling 分支</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Pooling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">3×3 max-pool 后接 1×1 projection</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Pooling within the core multibranch inception cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将四个空间对齐分支沿 channel 维合并\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Channel Concatenation within the core multibranch inception cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"通道拼接\" data-node-name-en=\"Channel Concatenation\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">通道拼接</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Channel Concatenation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将四个空间对齐分支沿 channel 维合并</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Channel Concatenation within the core multibranch inception cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多个模块与阶段间池化构成 22-layer 主干\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Inception within the core multibranch inception cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Inception 堆叠\" data-node-name-en=\"Inception\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Inception 堆叠</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Inception</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多个模块与阶段间池化构成 22-layer 主干</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Inception within the core multibranch inception cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"训练时从中间层接 auxiliary heads 改善梯度与正则化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Auxiliary Classifier within the core multibranch inception cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"辅助分类器\" data-node-name-en=\"Auxiliary Classifier\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">辅助分类器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Auxiliary Classifier</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练时从中间层接 auxiliary heads 改善梯度与正则化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Auxiliary Classifier within the core multibranch inception cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"全局平均池化、dropout、线性分类，替代大型 FC 堆叠\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies GAP to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"GAP 分类头\" data-node-name-en=\"GAP\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">GAP 分类头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">GAP</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">全局平均池化、dropout、线性分类，替代大型 FC 堆叠</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies GAP to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"主分类 logits\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces global classification logits and multi-scale intermediate representations via Class Logits Output.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"类别输出\" data-node-name-en=\"Class Logits Output\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_082_googlenet___inception_v1', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">类别输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Class Logits Output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">主分类 logits</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces global classification logits and multi-scale intermediate representations via Class Logits Output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"GoogLeNet / Inception-v1 Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · Inception 多尺度分支并行与通道拼接</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Parallel Multi-Scale Inception Branches with 1×1 Bottlenecks</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"GoogLeNet / Inception-v1：核心公式 · Inception 多尺度分支并行与通道拼接\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"82\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"17.865756pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.765054 -69.00913 332.728601 17.865756\" width=\"332.728601pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.832901-2.289597C3.81841-2.85475 3.448886-3.195292 2.847505-3.195292C2.304088-3.195292 1.905582-2.963434 1.441866-2.376544L1.666479-3.166309C1.666479-3.166309 1.651988-3.195292 1.630251-3.195292H1.623005L.347787-3.035889L.369524-2.927206C.615873-2.927206 .905695-2.927206 .91294-2.731576C.920186-2.644629 .637609-1.644742 .362278-.681083L-.043473 .941923C-.115929 1.275218-.224612 1.362165-.579645 1.369411L-.572399 1.48534H1.144798L1.137553 1.376656C.746293 1.376656 .601381 1.318692 .594136 1.15929C.594136 1.057852 .724556 .514435 .869467-.043473C1.079588 .050719 1.2245 .079701 1.42013 .079701C2.630138 .079701 3.876374-1.130307 3.832901-2.289597ZM3.072117-2.26786C3.093854-1.789653 2.883733-1.188272 2.550437-.746293C2.217141-.289822 1.818635-.057964 1.376656-.057964C1.144798-.057964 .970905-.166648 .963659-.32605C.956414-.572399 1.217254-1.514322 1.441866-2.057739C1.644742-2.535946 2.093967-2.883733 2.499718-2.883733H2.535946C2.890978-2.869242 3.057626-2.680857 3.0721