\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"245.778197\" xlink:href=\"#m082_g10-185\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"250.042206\" xlink:href=\"#m082_g16-45\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"256.911435\" xlink:href=\"#m082_g10-186\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"260.926368\" xlink:href=\"#m082_g4-17\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">单一路径卷积难同时覆盖多尺度，直接增加宽度计算昂贵</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Single-kernel convolutional layers struggled to capture multi-scale structures simultaneously, while naively widening layers exploded FLOPs.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在同一层并行组合 1×1、3×3、5×5 卷积和池化后拼接</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Execute parallel 1×1, 3×3, 5×5 convolutions and pooling within each layer and concatenate their outputs channel-wise.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以 1×1 bottleneck 降维并用 Inception 模块高效聚合多尺度</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">1×1 bottleneck projections compress channel dimensions prior to expensive spatial kernels for efficient multi-scale aggregation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">启发医学多尺度病灶检测和多分支 2D/3D 编码器</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Inspired multi-branch 2D/3D medical encoders and multi-scale lesion detection networks.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">多尺度设计仍重要；原始模块已被更简洁的残差和层级结构取代</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Multi-scale branching remains influential, though complex hand-tuned Inception topologies are largely superseded by residual/ConvNeXt blocks.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">同一层并行处理多个卷积尺度和 pooling，上下文由 concat 显式聚合。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">1×1 bottleneck 在昂贵 3×3/5×5 前降维，使多分支计算可控。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">辅助分类头只在训练中帮助梯度和正则化，推理主路径仍走最终 GAP head。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Execute parallel 1×1, 3×3, 5×5 convolutions and pooling within each layer and concatenate their outputs channel-wise.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: 1×1 bottleneck projections compress channel dimensions prior to expensive spatial kernels for efficient multi-scale aggregation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Parallel Multi-Scale Inception Branches with 1×1 Bottlenecks.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">多尺度分支思想适合大小差异显著的病灶、器官和纹理检测。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">原始 5×5 分支与复杂手工拓扑已少作首选；现代比较应控制参数量和训练 recipe。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Inspired multi-branch 2D/3D medical encoders and multi-scale lesion detection networks.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Multi-scale branching remains influential, though complex hand-tuned Inception topologies are largely superseded by residual/ConvNeXt blocks.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2015/html/Szegedy_Going_Deeper_With_2015_CVPR_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Going Deeper with Convolutions</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/BVLC/caffe/tree/master/models/bvlc_googlenet\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}